@startuml activity_workflow_2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam wrapWidth 170
skinparam maxMessageSize 110
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam swimlaneWidth 150

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #475569
skinparam ActivityBorderThickness 1.2
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.1

title **Workflow 2: Set Up an Area and Activate a Camera**

|#E0F2FE|Admin|
|#F0FDF4|Backend|
|#FEF3C7|Media Server & AI|
|#EDE9FE|Guard|

|Admin|
start
if (Area already exists?) then (No)
  :Step 1: Create an area and choose\nsecurity level (Public, Confidential,\nor Highly Confidential);
  |Backend|
  :Validate and save Area;
else (Yes)
endif

|Admin|
:Step 2: Create a camera and\nassign it to the area;

|Backend|
if (Area is active?) then (No)
  :Reject with error;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Save Camera (Offline);
endif

|Admin|
:Step 3: Enter connection details\nand start streaming;

|Backend|
:Verify connection & save config;

|Media Server & AI|
if (Stream ready?) then (No)
  :Keep camera Offline;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Start live stream &\nAI monitoring worker;
endif

|Admin|
:Step 4: Draw monitored region (ROI)\non the live camera image;

|Backend|
if (ROI valid?) then (No)
  :Show validation error;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Save ROI & sync to AI;
endif

|Guard|
:Step 5: View live camera stream;\nAI analyses stream using ROI;
stop

@enduml
